 Used With Durable Grooming Tools, Pets Always Enjoy All Cleaning Moment. 

### Feature:

1. SELF-CLEANING PET GROOMING BRUSH. 

2. Plug the button at the back side of brush to remove the dead fur or hair easily. 3. Handle is made of PP/TPR/ABS and pins are made of quality stainless steel. 

